{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/gen/step_cases.py","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:31:40.759983Z","id":"caf7a29b121bc3d610c3a4241ad2d374902ee8f602ee7a23e736a4653bbd8787","body":{"detail":"Each StepCase_<kind>.lean is produced by string substitution into gen/step_proof_template.txt, with the case closer in gen/tail_<kind>.txt. The vote case also gets an extra hypothesis by string replacement (hvf). A change to the template's text silently changes every case, and errors are reported against generated files. Closers find facts with anonymous-hypothesis patterns, which are slow when they fail against large contexts.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":38},"content_hash":"ef428fe824e9a506ace18e966d0e1c310b2aac46896601621d7a741850a0008a"},"suggested_fix":"Once all cases close, move the shared prefix into a Lean tactic macro (or a lemma over a generic message) and keep one checked-in Lean file per case.","summary":"step proofs are generated from a text template plus per-case tails rather than written as Lean","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/gen/step_cases.py","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:31:40.760010Z","id":"8b74f3e0e131fdec1548add1dc75d3a13e6e9bda35d4fbabd0d79b6a15737a58","body":{"detail":"The vote case takes (hvf : vf = .absent ∨ ∃ x, vf = .present (idv x)) for the voted_for field. Abs supplies it (Abs.state fixes vf = voteValue L.vote), so the simulation can discharge it, but Good does not carry it, so step_vote alone does not establish it for arbitrary nodes.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":30},"end":{"line":32},"content_hash":"bcd825d96a048e906e263d8442869f94382dd7542ae1b82abb1dfe6dd3453ab3"},"suggested_fix":"Add the vote-shape fact to Good (preserved by every step) or derive it from Abs where step_vote is used.","summary":"step_vote assumes the stored vote is absent or an id; nothing proves that for the implementation","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
